<title>UK: L-Bank to launch $500 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank to launch $500 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>L-Bank will launch a $500 million five-year Eurobond as soon as market conditions permit, Goldman Sachs International said on Wednesday as joint lead manager, having been awarded the mandate.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley International will be the other joint lead manager.  </p>
<p>The deal will be launched in the name of Baden-Wuerttemberg L-Finance, a finance arm of L-Bank, the state development agency of the German state of Baden-Wuerttemberg.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
